se to  town  one of the gals in town is a little  freaked about it so  we can talk about that and get some of  these details ironed out i think this is  going to be great  okay thanks a lot  oh yeah uh the number is eight seven  five seven one one two and we'll talk  thanks a lot bye  28.75 1.4  hey there it's uh tom miller again  haven't heard from you in a while i just  wanted to let you know me and some of  the guys are a little concerned that  there might be too many bears most of  the coyotes have moved on from town so  it's  probably about time the bears got out of  here  so we got to do that pretty soon it's  becoming a little bit of a problem so  give me a call the number is 875-7112  i hope to talk to you soon  bye  28.75 1.5  okay listen there are too many bears in  town now  a little boy got attacked just the other  day in the street he was with his mom  he got attacked by one of the bears okay  there are too many bears now  i need you to call me please as soon as  you can so we can do something about  this  okay  thanks  oh wait  eight seven five seven one one two okay  call me soon thanks bye  28.75 1.6  okay listen there's a bear outside of my  house okay my neighbor just got eated by  a bear okay there are bears in the  streets there are bears in people's  homes okay we gotta do something about  this there's  i can't get outside okay my kids are at  school i can't get to my kids  okay there's a bear on my car wicket oh  god  oh lord there's a bear in my house  oh 875 7112  [Applause]  this concludes today's lecture  thank you for listening if indeed you  still are and you are all dismissed  goodbye  i would like to give a special thank you  to  ian j allsup  zargaran  professor puffer  the morrigan  retalias  karim el ashmuy  savanity  kristoff kozak slesak  hms lily  the almighty fish  gav the clumsy containment specialist  spooky aqua  pure osmium  sciodio damnatis  brian sanchez  matthew gilmore  drew peacock eric corbidge  longinus  james saba  an